[doctor] okay. so, let's talk a little bit about what i've found. so, i do appreciate some pain with flexion and extension of your wrist, and i do appreciate decreased grip strength on the right compared to the left. i also appreciate a positive tinel's sign. so, what i think is going on is you have carpal tunnel syndrome.
