[patient] yeah, that sounds good.
[doctor] okay. do you have any questions?
[patient] no, that's it.
[doctor] okay. great. well, i'm gon na get you scheduled for the emg/nerve conduction study. my nurse will be in shortly to do that. do you have any other questions?
