[doctor]: Okay, got it. Have you tried any treatments for the pain so far?

[patient]: Yes, I've been using Tylenol and ibuprofen. I've also tried heat and ice. The ibuprofen seems to be a bit more helpful than the Tylenol, but it doesn't really relieve the pain.

