[patient]: Yes, it's been going on for a few days now. It's pretty uncomfortable.

[doctor]: Hmm, okay. Have you noticed any other symptoms like numbness or tingling in your feet?

[patient]: No, I haven't felt any numbness or tingling.

[doctor]: Alright. Have you had any recent changes in your diet or exercise routine?

