[doctor]: Now, let's check your heart and lungs. Your heart sounds fine and your lungs are clear.

[doctor]: I'll also check your back. There is no pain to palpation of the upper back, but there is pain to palpation of the midline of the lower back, especially on the left. There's also mild straight leg rise on the right and positive straight leg rise on the left.

