[doctor] so let's talk a little bit about your assessment and plan so you've made some improvement with your hydrocephalus since your shunt surgery there is a tiny fluid collection in the right parietal region i do not believe that this tiny amount of fluid is symptomatic and it was not documented by the radiologist when he read the ct scan
