[doctor] so i think the best course of treatment for you would be a laparoscopic cholecystectomy
[patient] okay
[doctor] and so we will have to do that surgery and i'll have my nurse come in and we can answer any questions you have and we can schedule that surgery for you
[patient] okay
[doctor] and so do you have any questions for me
[patient] yes i do
[doctor] okay
[patient] so i was wondering what kind of surgery is this
[doctor] it's a laparoscopic cholecystectomy so it's a minimally invasive surgery
[patient] okay
[doctor] where we'll make a few small incisions in your belly and put a camera and some instruments inside to remove your gallbladder
[patient] okay
[doctor] and you'll be asleep during the procedure and you'll be in the hospital for a few hours and then you'll go home
[patient] okay
[patient] okay
