[patient] i'm doing well. i was wondering if i could get a quick appointment to get my blood pressure checked.
[doctor] sure thing. i'd be happy to check your blood pressure. um, so you said you're having a little bit of a problem with your elbow. tell me more about that.
[patient] yeah, so i was playing lacrosse with my son over the weekend and he accidentally hit me with the stick and i'm having a little bit of pain in my elbow.
