[patient] this was saturday.
[doctor] okay. and how long ago did you start noticing the pain?
[patient] probably sunday.
[doctor] okay. and it's just pain, no numbness or tingling?
[patient] no, just pain.
[doctor] okay. and it's just on the right side?
[patient] yes.
